dzieci.\\n    *   Upewnij się, że dzieci nie bawią się kartą graficzną ani jej elementami.\\n8.  Utylizacja:\\n    *   Zużytą kartę graficzną należy utylizować zgodnie z lokalnymi przepisami dotyczącymi odpadów elektronicznych.\"}, \"responsibleProducers\": [{\"id\": \"192c16d2-8708-4d05-8eb7-c86debd9e987\", \"name\": \"Inno3D.\", \"producerData\": {\"address\": {\"city\": \"Nieuw-Vennep\", \"street\": \"PO BOX 108\", \"postalCode\": \"2150 AC\", \"countryCode\": \"NL\"}, \"contact\": {\"email\": \"eu-support@inno3d.com\", \"formUrl\": null, \"phoneNumber\": null}, \"tradeName\": \"Inno3D\"}}]}, \"trustedContent\": {\"paths\": [], \"productPaths\": []}, \"hasProtectedBrand\": false, \"aiCoCreatedContent\": {\"paths\": []}}','Karty graficzne',NULL,'GeForce RTX 5080 X3 16GB GDDR7 DLSS4'),(1390,'1a26ed24-b271-42d2-a389-945767c6f0c2',2325.00,21,'2024-07-23 14:28:36','{\"id\": \"1a26ed24-b271-42d2-a389-945767c6f0c2\", \"name\": \"Karta graficzna Inno3D GeForce RTX 5070 Ti 16 GB GDDR7 256-bit\", \"price\": 2325, \"stock\": 21, \"images\": [{\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/290662/f4752aa6458aad6b292c48c1d7d5\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/1146a2/f561abe54fc7b5de62df9a343103\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/111804/a73a0d2d4f3997237c041491a61a\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/1100a4/eaf483bd4ed6b9a4f24d6d0d0883\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/11eb8a/ef15a6e14336aef4d3c6389e8d8d\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/11c896/ba25c4c94d019ab061ae5097155a\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/11572c/61d572ee4e2c9b6382ce34888b5d\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/117f76/e700c6424524bbcca97521b18e63\"}], \"category\": {\"id\": \"260019\", \"path\": [{\"id\": \"954b95b6-43cf-4104-8354-dea4d9b10ddf\", \"name\": \"Allegro\"}, {\"id\": \"42540aec-367a-4e5e-b411-17c09b08e41f\", \"name\": \"Elektronika\"}, {\"id\": \"2\", \"name\": \"Komputery\"}, {\"id\": \"4226\", 