n*   Po zakończeniu użytkowania, usuń dane z dysku SSD w sposób bezpieczny, aby zapobiec nieautoryzowanemu dostępowi do danych.\\n*   Przestrzegaj zasad bezpiecznego obchodzenia się z odpadami elektronicznymi podczas utylizacji dysku SSD.\"}, \"responsibleProducers\": []}, \"trustedContent\": {\"paths\": [], \"productPaths\": []}, \"hasProtectedBrand\": false, \"aiCoCreatedContent\": {\"paths\": []}}','Dyski SSD',NULL,'SSD2041A'),(1582,'2e198bbb-dd9a-40e8-8bf2-99d8c2617a31',2013.00,1,'2022-07-11 18:57:37','{\"id\": \"2e198bbb-dd9a-40e8-8bf2-99d8c2617a31\", \"name\": \"Dysk SSD Verbatim Store \'n\' Go Slim Portable SSD 1TB 2,5\\\" USB-C\", \"price\": 2013, \"stock\": 1, \"images\": [{\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/29a50e/4fdb526748c593135d77354d2a2a\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/295a80/5cad230a43af81b88da576b644de\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/29026e/3f2d01364441ab46c2ed25f4db70\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/29ec57/a0c7274747079773f49ad7fb5b89\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/29441b/5c57f90740c19cbc88619dce7b2f\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/290bed/991f933548f5972668431ef2d5d6\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/116e4a/89674767425f8ac982b934be4f31\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/253d83/04f9e1e7481399b2a388b5953523\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/253b23/c3d0e31045779e50cab1f07a9eeb\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/25bfb1/eaaa4fa14adc91277a59d6a2c596\"}, {\"url\": \"https://a.allegroimg.com/original/2589be/1488dba647f187331fb89a56aa34\"}], \"category\": {\"id\": \"257335\", \"path\": [{\"id\": \"954b95b6-43cf-4104-8354-dea4d9b10ddf\", \"name\": \"Allegro\"}, {\"id\": \"42540aec-367a-4e5e-b411-17c09b08e41f\", \"name\": \"Elektronika\"}, {\"id\": \"2\", \"name\": \"Komputery\"}, {\"id\": \"4475\", \"name\": \"Dyski i pamięci przenośne\"}, {\"id\": \"257335\", \"name\": \"Dyski SSD\"}], \"similar\"